  "title": "SampCert",
  "excerpt": "A verified implementation using [Lean](https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and [Mathlib](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4) of randomized algorithms including [the discrete Gaussian sampler for differential privacy](https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.00010), key results in [zero concentrated differential privacy](https://arxiv.org/abs/1605.02065), and [some verified (unbounded) private queries](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1909.01917)."
 },
